($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20068750, $f$Klemmata$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$King Melanthios is well aware that Prince Hesperos has other intentions than pure love when he starts courting him, but it's difficult to resist him nonetheless.$f$, 13959, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-08-10T09:33:12.985+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-10T09:33:13.049+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20076337, $f$Ensnared$f$, ARRAY[$f$dornishsphinx$f$, $f$InkSplatterM$f$, $f$MrMissMrsRandom$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Collection of one-shots from various Alternate Universes where the real Peak Lord of Qing Jing and an unfavored son of the Lanling Jin Sect end up involved, in one form or another.$f$, 2917, 4, 4, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T16:48:56.751+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T16:48:56.767+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-26T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20081860, $f$your lipstick on my fingertips$f$, ARRAY[$f$avenqelic$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The other man had the most perfect lips in existence (no, Lan Wangji was not at all biased, it was just a fact), but they somehow looked even more perfect now, reflecting the light with slight shimmers, as if they were wet.  Wei Wuxian likes to wear lipstick. Lan Wangji likes to observe.$f$, 6612, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:54:51.577+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:54:51.595+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20087098, $f$The Memories of Another$f$, ARRAY[$f$OngNiel9596$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian found himself dreaming of a past that wasn’t his, and one that he had never known.$f$, 2207, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-11-04T12:44:36.206+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-04T12:44:36.234+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20094562, $f$All Tied Up$f$, ARRAY[$f$Gotcocomilk$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“San Lang, please,” Xie Lian pleaded, feeling a terrible mix of embarrassment and arousal curl in his skin. He was blushing a deep cherry red, he could tell, heat building across his cheeks relentless as the dawn. But he could not look away. Hua Cheng had let himself be bound and laid bare. Here, the great ghost king was at his mercy and in their bed. In the light of the lanterns of Paradise Manor, there was no greater sight.$f$, 4763, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-13T11:51:51.652+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T11:51:51.682+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20100916, $f$A Cracked and Broken Path$f$, ARRAY[$f$Naamah_Beherit$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Ling Wen has seen many gods ascend - prodigies and geniuses, those proficient in the blade and those who shape their fate with words. But never a god like him, never like this; never with madness in his eye and blood on his face.There’s a new god in the Heavens and he brings destruction.$f$, 2365, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-23T12:44:55.054+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-23T12:44:55.246+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20122561, $f$Secret Murals; Proposal in the Cave of Ten Thousand Gods$f$, ARRAY[$f$hanacity$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It's been over a year, but Xie Lian still wonders what it was on those murals that Feng Xin and Mu Qing wanted to hide from him so badly. 
Hua Cheng finally gives in and let's him take a look.$f$, 1493, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-20T04:24:50.772+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-20T04:24:50.793+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-05T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20129245, $f$Taste the wine off your lips$f$, ARRAY[$f$lanjingyeets$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A light pat lands against his back, and a cup of water is pushed in front of his face. “Not even Zi Shi, and you’re already tipsy?,” asks a teasing voice, while a thin hand puts down the cup.Jiang Cheng coughs a little more, shaking his head, and sends a dirty look at his host. “I am not tipsy.”“Hm, and yet your cheeks are all red. What would your disciples think, if they saw you in this state?”“They’d think about running away while they can. I can break legs more easily than I can drink alcohol.”A smile curves the edges of Nie Huaisang’s mouth, and he closes his fan with a curt jerk, sitting across the table. He’s wearing lighter clothes, Jiang Cheng notices, compared to the ones he had during the Discussion Conference. Where those had been tight and rigid against his body, these now fall softly on him, the large sleeves sweeping delicately as Nie Huaisang moves to pour himself a cup.$f$, 2352, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-19T03:44:05.685+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-19T03:44:05.706+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20137963, $f$as we thread through the seasons《一年四季》$f$, ARRAY[$f$Joythea$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$As a Cloudweaver, work is never-ending. It has been a while since she sewed Wei Wuxian’s forehead ribbon, so Lan Lianyi is not surprised when he arrives at the Cloudweavers’ Abode, eager to discuss potential arrays to put on the Gusu Lan robes. On another day, she also receives a personal request from Hanguang-jun to teach him how to sew. And a stroke of serendipity allows a certain ghost general to get a new set of clothes.Ah, indeed, work is never-ending no matter the season.$f$, 25667, 4, 4, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:46:47.447+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:46:47.464+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20139943, $f$The Teenage Girl's Self-Saving System$f$, ARRAY[$f$mercyandmagic$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When she prayed to Xie Lian not to let her die one fateful night, she certainly didn’t imagining her prayers would be answered...by transmigrating not just into the world of MDZS, but into the body of Wang LingJiao. Now she is guided by a Self-Saving System that requires she save one of the most the most odious characters in the entire MXTX universe.$f$, 108259, 20, 20, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-18T19:13:05.972+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-18T19:13:06.008+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20140666, $f$Sacrifice$f$, ARRAY[$f$KimoTherapy$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When Jiang Yanli and Jin Zixuan can't have a baby of their own, Wei Wuxian offers to help.$f$, 2330, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T21:01:19.571+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T21:01:19.591+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
