($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20171080, $f$Who Looks Inside, Awakes$f$, ARRAY[$f$Hamliet$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Jin GuangYao has spent years hiding one secret. Now, he has two to hide.$f$, 23767, 4, 4, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:58:12.860+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:58:12.899+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20172949, $f$Second Changes$f$, ARRAY[$f$STsuki$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Cuando un pequeño gesto inesperado, hace que las cosas sean diferentes, Jiang Cheng piensa que esta vez la felicidad no le será arrebatada tan fácilmente.----When an unexpected little gesture makes things different, Jiang Cheng thinks that this time happiness will not be so easily taken away.$f$, 2700, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:45:35.472+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:45:35.508+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20187913, $f$Happy Little Accident$f$, ARRAY[$f$sadisticbottom$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$What Lan Zhan doesn't know, works in Lan Huan's favour.Aka Wei Ying has amnesia, Lan Huan takes Wei Ying home where he belongs.$f$, 5200, 4, 4, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T08:00:04.958+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T08:00:04.999+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20209441, $f$The Gods of Love$f$, ARRAY[$f$0_Heta_0$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lan XiChen stepped forward, “Greeting mortals! As you can tell by our sudden arrival, we have something major to discuss with you all. I’m sure you have all noticed that, over these past few years, Olympus has been in peril. Since our best efforts have proven futile, we have come to request your assistance in this matter.”Confused silence was the reply he got. After shaking his head, Jiang WanYin stepped forward, “Basically, what he’s saying is ‘Olympus is fucked and you need to fix it.’” Alternatively:It's been almost ten years since the last humans fell in love, and they want to know why.$f$, 50284, 11, 15, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:33:16.232+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:33:16.245+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20220295, $f$[花怜］心跳过度（上）$f$, ARRAY[$f$CCitrus$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$花怜 - Fandom$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 4705, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T11:56:09.491+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T11:56:09.503+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20222686, $f$heartlines$f$, ARRAY[$f$lostincostco$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xie Lian used to think he was secure as a city protected by a wall of metal and a moat of boiling water, imperturbable in body and mind.Until Hua Cheng.$f$, 4431, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-23T12:24:36.960+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-23T12:24:36.994+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20234359, $f$the devil’s kiss$f$, ARRAY[$f$ethereal (gaebolg)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$For certain he’s too close. Xie Lian feels as if he’s in control, but ultimately he’s not. Certainly not with the way his heart and body are in agreement for once, completely set on ruining him.$f$, 1302, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-20T13:00:40.183+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-20T13:00:40.224+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20234914, $f$Accord$f$, ARRAY[$f$KimoTherapy$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Three years of playing uncle to Jin Ling leaves Wei Wuxian wanting a child of his own.$f$, 4499, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T21:01:14.967+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T21:01:15.000+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20239570, $f$MODAOZUSHI MINECRAFT$f$, ARRAY[$f$jiggypuffismysonbaby$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$written by depressed_wanyin & hyegguk on instagrammodaozushi but it's Minecraft and creeper aw man discord memein which wei wuxian accidentally falls through a worm hole into an alternative world where everyone is alive aka the modern world but he's actually stuck in Minecraft while everyone else isn'tThere is smut$f$, 7285, 10, 50, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:31:18.956+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:31:18.979+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-05T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20261701, $f$Cradle (Traducción)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Kuro_Neko4869$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Después de apenas sobrevivir al intento de asesinato en QiongQi Path, Wei WuXian y los remanentes de la Secta Wen son dejados para averiguar como protegerse a si mismos y a sus nuevas vidas. Mientras tanto, los hermanos Jiang y un ileso Jin ZiXuan tratan de averiguar de quien fue la brillante idea de esa estúpida emboscada. En Gusu, Lan WanJi entra en pánico ante la idea de la muerte de Wei WuXian y trata de decidir si insistir en quedarse al lado del Patriarca Yiling o quedarse en los Recesos de la Nube.
Y Wei WuXian lucha con la idea de que convertirse en maestro, enseñar el cultivo demoníaco y establecer su propia secta podría no ser una mala idea después de todo...$f$, 95321, 15, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:40:44.369+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:40:44.395+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20261824, $f$Dear Heart$f$, ARRAY[$f$zacechild$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It's easy for Mu Qing to bury his love for Xie Lian and pretend it's dead. And then Hua Cheng and Xie Lian dig it up for him. (Warning: takes place post-canon, so beware of possible spoilers!)$f$, 16631, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:45:30.190+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:45:30.225+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20272495, $f$Ragdoll$f$, ARRAY[$f$alluringcookies$f$, $f$Leachy$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"Use me as you'd like, gege." Hua Cheng offers his body to be used like a ragdoll by Xie Lian, who finds it terribly awkward and embarrassing. Nevertheless, if Hua Cheng is willing to do it, then Xie Lian will be willing to try.$f$, 1391, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-13T12:01:17.231+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T12:01:17.262+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20284132, $f$Bind Me, Heal Me, Break Me$f$, ARRAY[$f$Gotcocomilk$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lan Zhan looked too old, sometimes, staring into the blinding sun of dawn. He looked like he had gone somewhere Wei Wuxian couldn’t follow, beyond the scope of the horizon. Resentful energy swirled black and terrible at that thought, and Wei Wuxian laughed it to shattering pieces. Lan Zhan had stayed, but that didn’t mean he would forever.$f$, 11684, 2, 2, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-26T01:35:07.914+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-26T01:35:07.949+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20286943, $f$Wet$f$, ARRAY[$f$GoldenVendetta$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Jin GuangYao returns a drunken Jin GuangShan back to Koi Tower after yet another night out at the brothels. Cleaning up before bed, the sect leader encounters Mo XuanYu who is more than eager to help.$f$, 2327, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:47:16.548+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:47:16.586+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20288641, $f$kiss me hard before you go$f$, ARRAY[$f$ibreatheakaashi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$They had rules. No, they weren’t rules, but simply suggestions to maneuver their way into their relationship. It wasn’t even a relationship, as Wei Wuxian contemplates their whole dynamic. What were they? There was a word for their peculiar friendship- yes, they were friends, with a few exceptions. Friends don’t kiss or shove their tongues together rather passionately. They don’t hug intimately or fall in love. Wei Wuxian contemplates the true meaning behind "friends with benefits" or Five times Lan Wangji leaves and one time he stays$f$, 6173, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T08:00:33.168+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T08:00:33.183+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20308216, $f$Restart$f$, ARRAY[$f$Silver_Flame_2724$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian and five other people were given a second chance at life. Will they be able to prevent the past tragedies from occurring again?$f$, 100189, 26, 26, true, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:53:59.555+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:53:59.591+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20311834, $f$for what you truly are$f$, ARRAY[$f$Einhorn$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The unicorn lived in an autumn wood, and he lived all alone.$f$, 6532, 1, 2, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-12T11:24:32.729+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-12T11:24:32.771+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20312848, $f$Lammas Night$f$, ARRAY[$f$Shakja$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu is an unfortunate person.
Outcast by her coven and family for her lacking powers and unfounded rumors the male born witch finds herself alone in the world. When she is given the chance for a fresh start in a small village she accepts it gladly. But why is there the feeling of being watched since she moved into the abandoned house of the last wizard who died here thirteen years ago?$f$, 2445, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:44:30.415+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:44:30.439+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20315335, $f$Герой своего же романа$f$, ARRAY[$f$Kenilvort$f$, $f$MXTXLonghaired$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$Grandmaster of Demonic Cultivation$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Даже самое запутанное дело об убийстве не столь запутано, как чувства$f$, 53107, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:44:02.700+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:44:02.731+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20315965, $f$interlude$f$, ARRAY[$f$WashedAshore$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Huaisang decides to take a day off. Shenanigans ensue.$f$, 2856, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-02T00:44:48.738+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-02T00:44:48.765+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20318779, $f$Promise$f$, ARRAY[$f$ThetenthtenbeingofTen$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lan Zhan is a teacher at his family’s Music Academy, and one of his new pupils happens to bring him back in touch with one certain person…$f$, 4063, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:58:48.857+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:58:48.885+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20321932, $f$Wei-Ge$f$, ARRAY[$f$ThetenthtenbeingofTen$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A-Yu is fine most of the time, really.He doesn’t cry, doesn’t stutter, doesn’t even think about the things that scare him most of the time.
 
  But sometimes…
 
A look into Wei Ying and Mo Xuanyu's life together.$f$, 1549, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T13:27:46.101+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T13:27:46.118+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20330641, $f$inappropriate use of coffins$f$, ARRAY[$f$ethereal (gaebolg)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$To say the coffin is cramped is certainly an understatement.$f$, 843, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-13T12:12:30.706+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T12:12:30.730+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20331046, $f$Loyal Friend$f$, ARRAY[$f$ThetenthtenbeingofTen$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu never had friends. He had Yao-Gege, sure... but that went... not good.
Now that even his family has given up on him and shoved him into the next-best clinic he doesn't have high hopes to ever find anyone to truly rely on.
But then... he stumbles across a person who is crying so hard, curled up in a corner. And for some reason this person smiled at him.$f$, 2758, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T14:09:49.186+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T14:09:49.206+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20335783, $f$Ashes and Moonlight$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$For a long time, what separated gods and demons was defined only by where they went: up or down.$f$, 107273, 19, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:36:44.696+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:36:44.722+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20336299, $f$Festival In The Ghost City$f$, ARRAY[$f$SilverWingedPhoenix$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$One day there was a festival happening at the ghost city. It was the lantern festival.$f$, 6452, 1, 2, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:58:30.881+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:58:30.918+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20338426, $f$La esposa es primero.$f$, ARRAY[$f$Luka_Crosszeria$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$¿Renacer un año antes de que el apocalipsis comience?¡Eso es genial! Dado que lo último que recuerdas es tu espantosa y trágica muerte. ¿Qué es lo que usualmente harías en esta situación? ¡Obviamente prepararte para el comienzo del apocalipsis! ¿No?¿Vaciar el supermercado local y los pequeños negocios, acaparando toda la comida y agua que puedas? ¿Buscar un refugio cerca de las zonas que, más tarde, serían inaccesibles por su alta seguridad? ¿Alertar a todo mundo? ¿Mantener a salvo a tus padres adoptivos, de los cuales, perdiste todo rastro en los últimos cinco años en el apocalipsis? ¡Por supuesto, NO!Lan Yuan: "¡La esposa es primero! ¡Deprisa, encuentrala!"La adorable esposa que no sabía nada; Lan Jingyi: "..."$f$, 4893, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:38:16.409+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:38:16.425+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20341714, $f$Maybe the real friendship was the fierce corpses we made along the way.$f$, ARRAY[$f$IceBreeze$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“No! No, you don’t get to walk away from me anymore,” Shi Qingxuan said, and in that moment she looked more like Shi WuDu than she ever has. She looks like the brother she so adored, the one she would have chosen over anything (over the world, over He Xuan, over herself even), and He Xuan wishes she could hate her like she did Shi WuDu. It would be so much easier, then- would allow her to move on without every step feeling like it was through water, able to hold her head high and heart cold without the steady drip, drip, drip of longing filling every waking moment.
  (It would be so much easier if she was as much of a demon as everyone believed her to be, the Yiling patriarch more than just a name she never wanted).
He Xuan disappeared after the burning of Lotus Pier and returned different. Shi Qingxuan wants to know why. Shi Wu Du is still Shi Wu Dead.(An MDZS AU where He Xuan is Wei Wuxian but not, Shi Qingxuan is Lan Wangji but also kind of Jiang Cheng, and both are lesbians).Beafleaf week day 6: Love/hate$f$, 5751, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T11:53:08.757+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T11:53:08.784+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20346865, $f$THE WEAVER'S FATE$f$, ARRAY[$f$ServerGoneError$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Basically Jiang Cheng is secretly weaver and god immortal knowing the fate ever since he was born and child. Let say he knows.$f$, 5169, 2, 2, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:46:56.855+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:46:56.889+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20350177, $f$Scanf ("%s", &action)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Verse$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$You know how it goes: people are born, live, die. Then they're born again, live again, die again. Over and over, again and again.... Usually.Sometimes, it goes... wrong.Ah, but please, ignore this old one's rambling. Select your player. Select an action. I'll try to keep you alive from here.$f$, 22071, 14, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:44:27.956+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:44:28.018+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20353954, $f$just like a lighthouse in the storm.$f$, ARRAY[$f$Bakaizer$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lan Xichen used to see him all the time. Jiang Cheng was his family and became part of his life so when he disappeard overnight, Xichen couldn't help but feel lost. In the end, life kept going but he never really forgot the boy he used to watch over. Until one day, he is given an opportunity to reconnect with him only to be met by a cold stranger. Only this time, Xichen won't let them grow apart and will do everything to get the answers he deserves.$f$, 6385, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T14:14:04.341+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T14:14:04.379+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20360782, $f$Dark Nights$f$, ARRAY[$f$ThetenthtenbeingofTen$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lan Zhan asks Wei Ying to babysit Lan Yuan...$f$, 7500, 2, 2, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:59:29.408+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:59:29.447+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20380948, $f$Spoilt Rotten$f$, ARRAY[$f$chocolatebun$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“San Lang…” Xie Lian whispers, the whimper barely audible, his voice long gone hoarse.“What does Gege want?” Hua Cheng sighs by his ear, hot breath and heady tone making Xie Lian’s head spin uselessly as he grasps for words, voicelessly pleading for Hua Cheng to give him release. He’s so close, and yet every time when he’s just about to reach, Hua Cheng’s touch leaves him stuttering on the edge.Anyone could walk in and see Xie Lian like this, one of the ghosts who served as Hua Cheng’s subordinates or the blushing maids of Paradise Manor, to see the former proud crown prince, the strongest martial god renowned throughout the three realms in such a shameless position.$f$, 2776, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-21T09:17:48.592+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-21T09:17:48.625+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20405932, $f$Heaven's Grandmaster of Self-Saving$f$, ARRAY[$f$Hamliet$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"You cannot outrun time or your sins. Not now, or ever. No matter what, you will always end up back in this place."Jin GuangYao is dead, throat crushed by the brother he killed and the weight of his lies. But when a fallen god seeking redemption himself persuades a hopelessly lost mortal to free his soul from the casket, Jin GuangYao is given one last chance: travel back, relive it all, and change the fates of three worlds. Or, Jun Wu tasks Jin GuangYao with the task of redeeming himself, Shen Jiu, and Jun Wu.$f$, 156768, 34, 34, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-19T03:29:03.134+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-19T03:29:03.146+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20407954, $f$A Touch of Lightness$f$, ARRAY[$f$MrMissMrsRandom$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu almost convinced himself that a solitary life may be his lot, but friendship always comes from the oddest circumstances.$f$, 2425, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:40:22.581+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:40:22.612+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20409166, $f$Ever After$f$, ARRAY[$f$GirlApart5$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xie Lian did a lot of thinking, and came to a decision faster than one would expect of someone who had spent 800 years celibate without regret. But when he thought about it, the decision was easy. After all, he wasn't breaking his vow for just anyone. He was breaking it for the man who loved all of him.$f$, 8315, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-11T12:16:58.413+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-11T12:16:58.459+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20415127, $f$Pearls, Shark Teeth, and Other Baubles$f$, ARRAY[$f$RoseusJaeger$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Sirens believe in soulmates; they find compatible mates through song and often mate for life.  Alphas are naturally deaf and can only hear the song of their Omega soulmate, with those being unable to produce offspring or are uninterested in mating being considered Betas. Wei WuXian is an Omega of breeding age out to find a mate. With many Alphas trying to court him, he considers it a fun game to see who can bring him the best gifts. None of them hear his singing voice so they have no chance of winning him over. He wants a mate who won't tie him down to pod life.At least, he believes that until he meets Lan WangJi, a wandering Alpha who seems more interested in his company than actually mating with him.$f$, 25979, 9, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:29:31.256+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:29:31.275+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20420840, $f$Forever Young$f$, ARRAY[$f$havisham$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Neil meets a long-lost relative, Samuel provides invaluable assistance and Delaney finally admits his feelings -- to the disinterest of all involved.$f$, 32374, 6, 8, false, 5, false, $f$2019-12-29T10:36:16.129+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-29T10:36:16.262+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
