($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20451359, $f$The Heart of Lan-Er-Gege$f$, ARRAY[$f$ThetenthtenbeingofTen$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Ying and Mo Xuanyu were only supposed to stay until Friday. Okay, Saturday.
Okay, Sunday.
 
Fine. Just stay forever.$f$, 6762, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T13:27:53.678+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T13:27:53.695+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20490308, $f$let your dreams be dreams$f$, ARRAY[$f$atomicmuffin$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 38909, 7, 8, false, 1, false, $f$2019-10-11T13:14:18.404+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-11T13:14:18.449+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20496242, $f$Sacrificio$f$, ARRAY[$f$Dayan$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Cuando los cielos se abrieron, la tierra se quebró, alzando océanos y quebrantando almas, nació la segunda naturaleza que equilibraría el mundo, con ello, arrastrando a Wei Wuxian en el trayecto. Jiang Fengmian lo sabía. 
Lo sabía con tanta certeza así como sabe que desea ser cómo él.
Advertencias dentro.$f$, 46029, 10, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:46:09.081+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:46:09.118+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20504732, $f$Offering to the Demon$f$, ARRAY[$f$mici_micelle$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"Are you really not afraid of what I can do to you?" Xie Lian became one of the Four Great Calamities, promising revenge to those who had wronged him while Hua Cheng ascended to stand among the gods he despised so much. Xie Lian, fueled by revenge, turned the mortal realm inside out and if it wasn't for Jun Wu, Xie Lian would've continued until the gods themselves would directly feel his wrath. By the skin of his teeth, or maybe with someone’s help, Xie Lian escaped and from then on was never heard of again. After that though, Hua Cheng also vanished, until more than a decade later Heaven heard his voice once again.$f$, 3254, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-14T04:02:11.008+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-14T04:02:11.046+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20506790, $f$Love me, cherish me (and never let me go)$f$, ARRAY[$f$lanjingyeets$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Sand warmed quickly under his naked feet, water a fresh caress against his calves. The small waves kissed at the hem of his trousers, seeping through the delicate silk and making it heavier, enough to be noticed but not enough to make it hard to move around.Hua Cheng watched as another wave approached, bigger this time; it hit his knees and almost made him stumble, his heel sinking in the wet sand and arms opening wide.The wind blew up his shirt as he breathed, in, out, in, out.The sea breathed with him$f$, 2342, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-12T22:56:49.635+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-12T22:56:49.677+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20508707, $f$My heart belonged to you, long before I met you.$f$, ARRAY[$f$Iamtheuwunow$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When souls bond to one another, it's a connection which starts by destiny but once it's awakened nothing will ever be the same. With hearts beating in the same rhythm and minds that strangely have meddled into one, confusion but new-found fondness and passion grows. Soulmates are rare and powerful in the world of cultivators. When trained and acquainted well, they can rise to heights no other cultivator ever dared to reach for. 
When the day comes that a thunderstorm roars louder than any beast that ever stepped into this world, an unknown force rushes through them at the mere contact of their blades clashing. But neither Lan Wangji nor Wei Wuxian would have thought that once their skin touches, their world would turn upside down. 
The always controlled ice-cold pride of the Lan Sect, one part of the Jade Twins Lan Wangji and the wild, free-spirited and sometimes utter shameless Wei Wuxian turn out to be just exactly what each other needed.$f$, 7879, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T13:29:29.403+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T13:29:29.413+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-28T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20536247, $f$sweet taste$f$, ARRAY[$f$kaijuerotica$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xie Lian realizes too late just how much he's attracted to Shi QingXuan.Luckily for the two of them, their husbands are very understanding.$f$, 5183, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:53:40.402+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:53:40.445+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-05T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
