($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20539202, $f$Он не вернется$f$, ARRAY[$f$sophie_jenkins$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Правдивая история о возвращении Старейшины, рассказанная непосредственным участником.$f$, 931, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:42:14.827+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:42:14.851+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20562239, $f$C.C.Lemon$f$, ARRAY[$f$Okiray$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$谢怜有点不高兴$f$, 8050, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T11:55:22.786+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T11:55:22.835+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20569760, $f$My Darling Desire$f$, ARRAY[$f$zacechild$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xie Lian considers himself to be fairly old-fashioned. So when his boyfriend Hua Cheng asks to see his "sword," he goes to Shi Qing Xuan for help."Help" involves shopping for thigh high stockings.$f$, 8419, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:50:24.539+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:50:24.566+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20570282, $f$Iridiscente$f$, ARRAY[$f$Dayan$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Meng Yao es un chico a punto de cumplir dieciocho años, pronto postulará para una prestigiosa universidad con el ahorro de todos los años que estuvo trabajando. Ahí conocerá amigos, hermanos, y mucho sufrimiento que deberá pagar debido a causas que sucedieron antes de su nacimiento.$f$, 4068, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:39:22.633+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:39:22.653+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20572055, $f$together$f$, ARRAY[$f$chocolatebun$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In the myriad of silk blankets and pillows he’s woven around to fortify himself, tucked securely away from prying eyes with crimson brocade curtains cloaking their canopy bed, Xie Lian stirs.$f$, 3109, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:46:16.972+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:46:17.009+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20573801, $f$willing to work for this (just show me where to dig)$f$, ARRAY[$f$putsch$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Nie Huaisang leans over, and ugh, there's his most annoying smirk. "Did you meet somebody?"Unbidden, Lan Huan's smile, his easy going nature, the way he said Nie Mingjue's name all come to mind. It makes him stop for a second - they didn't even speak for that long, and parted ways with nothing special between them. It wasn't an average meeting, but Nie Mingjue is sure it wouldn't warrant him being in a better mood than normal.( a college professors living, working, and getting together in nyc au )$f$, 39406, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:41:33.881+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:41:33.913+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20578586, $f$Red and White$f$, ARRAY[$f$hypermoyashi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$His world was four painfully white walls.This had been true for most of his living memory, the world proven cold and uncaring as he was used as little more than a blood sack. That is, until a shining figure in white descended and broke his cage.$f$, 3915, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-12T11:23:38.304+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-12T11:23:38.338+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20583854, $f$endlessly$f$, ARRAY[$f$ethereal (gaebolg)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"I want to worship you forever."$f$, 3127, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-13T13:48:16.031+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T13:48:16.058+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20585492, $f$a little bit lost (without you)$f$, ARRAY[$f$persicae$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When Xie Lian is hurt, Hua Cheng keeps his hands to himself in penance. Xie Lian, however, insists on finding a resolution. After all - only a god should punish their most beloved worshipper.$f$, 4322, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-15T07:30:16.333+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-15T07:30:16.349+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20593805, $f$A Game for the Fool$f$, ARRAY[$f$LadyCroft_Undead19$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$How do you want to be remembered?Obviously one will always want to be remembered as a good person, someone great whose virtues outweigh the flaws, of course they'd want to be remembered as someone who did something in life, who accomplished something with the time they were given, someone others could be proud of, or remember fondly of, years down the road.Everyone always wants to be remembered when they were at their best and not at their lowest.
I like to believe I was a good person, funny and smart and kind, someone who proved to be a good role model for future generations.I died content.I wonder why, then, did I find myself in such a peculiar situation?
"Quest: Grandmaster of Demonic Cultivation""Will you accept this Quest?"[YES] [NO]$f$, 163860, 58, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-22T17:49:52.843+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-22T17:49:52.860+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20598215, $f$perfected by trial$f$, ARRAY[$f$silvercistern$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Hua Cheng has wanted Dianxia for so long he doesn’t know how to survive knowing that Dianxia is his at long last. Worse still, Dianxia doesn’t seem to have any interest in consummating their relationship, leaving Hua Cheng in the midst of his greatest trial yet: keeping his lust from consuming them whole.
But a gem cannot be polished without friction, nor a man perfected without trials - and after everything, Hua Cheng will not let this trial be the one that defeats him.$f$, 8553, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-08T22:11:36.670+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-08T22:11:36.690+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
