($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20693213, $f$Ghosts of Yiling$f$, ARRAY[$f$marizousbooty$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$[He opened his eyes and reached out to clasp the first hand he found within the writhing masses and Lan Zhan, his body pressed firmly to so many people, his hair stuck to someone’s sweaty arm, so many different breaths and screams were running down his neck, felt his hand grabbed by Wei Ying’s clammy one and for a moment he didn’t care he was in the most uncomfortable spot he’s ever been in his life. None of that mattered with the hot press of metal from Wei Ying’s rings, the itch of black lace from his sleeve scraping Lan Zhan’s skin, the firmness of Wei Ying’s palms, his wide, sparkling eyes looking into the crowd and noticed who’s hand he was holding. Lan Zhan’s breath caught in his throat when their eyes met and recognition flashed across Wei Ying’s face. ]---Lan Zhan finds him amongst the stars far above his head.$f$, 6181, 1, 7, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:47:10.639+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:47:10.686+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20703209, $f$gimme sugar$f$, ARRAY[$f$tinygrunt$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$At the tender age of twenty-five, Wei Ying's aunt cuts him off. When his friend suggests a quick fix in the form of a dubious dating app, Wei Ying knows he has to give it a shot. Enter Bichen, an absurdly wealthy, absurdly lonely young attorney, whose sparse words and penchant for gift-giving have Wei Ying falling before he can turn tail and run. It's a match made in heaven. Or, more specifically, Seeking Arrangement.$f$, 7663, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:27.701+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:27.720+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20708597, $f$The God of Chaos$f$, ARRAY[$f$Taer01$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian reigned as the God of Chaos. And the God of Chaos has his sights on the God of Light. However, there is something powerful and sinister that has awakened, and its hungry. It wants power, it wants to rule over all.Will Wei Wuxian be able to stop it? With tensions growing high between the Gods, if they don't watch their steps, a war could be brewing.If they focus on infighting and not the rising enemy, it could be their downfall. But who knows what the future holds?$f$, 4904, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:47:05.616+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:47:05.635+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-28T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
