($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20723807, $f$Mo Xuanyu Drabble$f$, ARRAY[$f$ItsaPseudonym8$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$With those thoughts he took the knife in his hands and made the required cuts on his inner arms. As the blood began to spill out and Xuanyu started writing with it, he felt a bit of relief.It would soon be all over.$f$, 908, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-19T03:27:53.983+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-19T03:27:54.015+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20753552, $f$i felt it shelter to speak to you$f$, ARRAY[$f$jellybabiestomanual$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$女将军和长公主 | Female General and Eldest Princess$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Your heavy injury is just healing, I will have Ah-Yin and Yu Wan boil medicine and serve food, once you’ve drank the medicine and had your meal, please have a good rest, I will be leaving.”

 
Li Xian turned to leave the tent, her nobility written in every aspect of her posture, incongruous with the dirty, bloody camp full of soldiers that surrounded her. She had important places to be, surely. Important things to do other than sitting at Lin Wanyue’s bedside, speaking soft words that ignited Lin Wanyue’s heart. It was far from Lin Wanyue’s place to detain her, no matter how much she wanted her to stay, and she knew it.
But, half-delirious, her mouth worked faster than her brain could. “Princess, please-”
