($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20855624, $f$TRICK OR TREAT!!!!! get y'all's candies (cummies)$f$, ARRAY[$f$takuu$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Kinktober 20191. HuaLian: creampie + cockwarming$f$, 1688, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-12T11:27:20.747+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-12T11:27:20.767+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-05T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20856425, $f$operation matchmaker$f$, ARRAY[$f$silversshadow$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$What Jin Ling knows about Wei Yings failed marriage is this: One, they met at the same shitty Gusu summer camp Jin Ling is currently stuck at. Two, they adopted a kid before they got married? Somehow? And three, after some sort of thing happened Wei Ying went back to living with Jiang Cheng in Yunmeng.Number four is the fact that for some reason one of his roommates here has a picture of Wei Ying and some other guy in wedding robes and holding a kid???$f$, 4289, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-05T02:52:31.644+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-05T02:52:31.676+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20859575, $f$Misunderstandings$f$, ARRAY[$f$Nem (Himeji)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It was a suggestion spoken as dare by his idiot brother and his pride wouldn’t let him not rise to the challenge.Or Jiang Cheng becomes a nude model for one of the university's art classes, oh and Nie Huaisang happens to be in it, oops.$f$, 7156, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:41:48.264+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:41:48.288+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20861270, $f$The Art of War$f$, ARRAY[$f$jellynebula$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In a mid-twenty-first century technologically advanced society where members of the public now have cybernetic brains, Jin Guangyao strives to win his father’s approval to become the leader of the Five Families, China’s most powerful criminal underground network. Futuristic mobster AU.$f$, 4974, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:37:16.326+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:37:16.354+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20874008, $f$Blind Maiden$f$, ARRAY[$f$ElsyAnimetronik$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lo que había comenzado como un simple viaje a QíShān para reforzar los tratados de paz entre la secta Wēn y las demás sectas, terminó convirtiéndose en una situación... "extraña" pero a la vez -aunque Xuē Yáng no lo admita- excitante... y a la vez preocupante...$f$, 14680, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:36:37.481+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:36:37.507+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20874797, $f$boyfriend material$f$, ARRAY[$f$ricken$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lan Xichen would do anything if it meant his brother was happy, which is what lead him to eavesdropping on the Jiang brothers as they discussed their requirements for a partner. Or; Lan Wangji attempts to woo an already infatuated Wei Ying using bad pickup lines, and a few more things.$f$, 41689, 10, 10, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:41:30.862+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:41:30.887+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20887151, $f$The Heartless Founder of  Demonic Love.$f$, ARRAY[$f$An0therWerid0$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV) RPF$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Are we talking about the same Nie Huaisang?”“Mn.” Hanguang-Jun answered to him as he left his sword bichen at his side before to full Wei Ying's cup again with wine. “A Qi Deviation, six years after your death.”“How he could have died by a qi deviation if he barely held his saber from the beginning? Even when the war was among to start he didn’t do that! It’s make no sense!”“His golden core was weakened by an unknown disease, it made him unable to handle the saber spirit, or that’s what Nie Mingjue and brother Xichen could figured out.““Lan Zhan… Are you thinking the same as me?”“Mn.” Hanguang-Jun made a pause and looked over the slender arm wrapped in white cloth. “Someone murdered Nie Huaisang, and there is another person who wants to bring it out.”$f$, 37423, 5, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-19T03:29:59.618+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-19T03:29:59.647+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20895437, $f$Sacred Heart$f$, ARRAY[$f$Haserl$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Just like many others, Hua Cheng was someone born in the old empire, resistant against the impositions and the holy supremacy of the new emperor.---After being chased and violently punished by the empire guards, Hua Cheng is saved and nursed back to health by Xie Lian. Time mends his wounds, but Xie Lian’s transcending love mends his heart.$f$, 7233, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T11:52:30.482+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T11:52:30.513+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20900012, $f$Every Lantern Comes Home$f$, ARRAY[$f$cinnasins$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After Hua Cheng returns in a blaze of glory, all he wants to do is elope with Xie Lian, and maybe piss off Heaven while he's at it. Xie Lian has other ideas and is determined to (force) Hua Cheng to make friends. Inspired by the series Natsume's Book of Friends, Hualian learns how to socialize with people other than themselves. Investigating ghosts and spirits that can't seem to pass onto the next life, all whIle juggling friendships and complicated feelings for each other, shenanigans and hijinks ensue! Aka self indulgent fic of me making sure Hua Cheng and Xie Lian know they're loved and spreading that to others, never to be lonely and afraid again. Please check out the anime/light novel Natsume's Book of Friends if you'd like to know what inspired this fic! It's a really sweet story of a boy who can see spirits, inherits a book of names from his grandmother with the same power, and helps release yokai who have too firm a grip on this world. Touching story of a once lonely boy who makes friends through empathizing with ghosts and demons.$f$, 4426, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:55:24.062+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:55:24.200+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-05T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20904698, $f$Cepillo$f$, ARRAY[$f$Narialam$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"Después del continuo maltrato sobre su persona Mo Xuanyu no estaba seguro de si se encontraba ante su salvador o ante la continuación de su pesadilla". One-Shot.$f$, 2579, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:30:55.487+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:30:55.519+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
