($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20920754, $f$El día que lo encontré.$f$, ARRAY[$f$Luka_Crosszeria$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$De hecho, fue un largo, largo, largo sueño, uno doloroso y aterrador, un sueño donde me casaba con mi pequeño bollo al vapor,  lo lastimé y lo hice infeliz en mi feliz ignorancia, un sueño en donde también lo perdí.$f$, 3572, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:31:26.656+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:31:26.678+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20928185, $f$Kinktober 2019 Day 12 - Licking/ Rimming$f$, ARRAY[$f$smutbunni10$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Mo Dao Zu Shi$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu, crazy lunatic, and his father Jin Guangshan makr the perfect - couple for disgusting pervy sex. Guangshan loves licking and Xuanyu likes to be eaten.$f$, 1466, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:36:19.620+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:36:19.648+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20937593, $f$Family Is The Heart of Our Home$f$, ARRAY[$f$Chisie$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A modern AU where the children are all in the kindergarten and WangXian is just being Wangxian. Wen Yuan wants to be adopted by Wei Wuxian and Lan Wangji, but will he be adopted in the end?$f$, 16727, 5, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:51:56.298+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:51:56.335+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-26T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20945852, $f$The Puppetmaster of Shunfu$f$, ARRAY[$f$AverageTrailerTrash$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$What if Xue Yang failed to recreate the Stygian Tiger Seal? What if the pieces were stolen and embedded in a body to create a living weapon for the late Yiling Patriarch? What if there was something else lurking inside the seal, something desperate for a master's orders?
or: the consequence of Nie Huaisang and Mo Xuanyu repeatedly fucking everything up (feat: Wei Wuxian avoiding his responsibilities).
or: how the cultivation world came to fear a tired teenager and his possessive keeper (feat: unsupportive friends who eventually get over it).$f$, 18323, 5, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:54:28.143+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:54:28.159+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20950454, $f$"I cant do this anymore"$f$, ARRAY[$f$Jamilton_and_Lams$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Mo Dao Zu Shi$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A tear rolled down his cheek and he angrily bushed it away before it could ruin his makeup. I can't do this anymore, theres no other way....$f$, 231, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-18T22:13:45.221+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-18T22:13:45.256+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20953178, $f$"Maybe it's too late"$f$, ARRAY[$f$Jamilton_and_Lams$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Mo Dao Zu Shi$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A folder was thrown at him. He bent down to pick it up and flipped it over to see the photo. He dropped it and glanced up at his friend to see the muzzle of a gun being pointed at him and the tear streaked face behind it$f$, 525, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:55:25.016+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:55:25.046+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20979176, $f$What happens when the Ghost King is lonely...$f$, ARRAY[$f$Sianera$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Some little, self-indulgent fun I had planned to write for quite some time now~$f$, 923, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-13T12:15:16.883+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T12:15:16.903+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20988290, $f$"Don't leave me"$f$, ARRAY[$f$Jamilton_and_Lams$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Mo Dao Zu Shi$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Ying was dying.$f$, 443, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T16:50:43.426+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T16:50:43.445+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 20995106, $f$Bueno…quizás estoy enamorado$f$, ARRAY[$f$Lunayfirefly$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Que Wei Wu Xian le dijera “tonto” le tenía sin cuidado.  Que Wen Qing lo llamara así le molestaba, pero trataba de ignorarlo. Pero que su jie, junto con una sonrisa dulce, opinara igual que los otros dos, no hacía más que confundirlo.  Así que Jiang Cheng fue en busca de la única persona que todavía parecía respetarlo y que quizás le pudiera explicar por qué de pronto había sido nombrado así. Lo que no se esperaba era encontrar a Nie Huaisang riendo coquetamente junto con el estudiante más popular de la facultad de arte.$f$, 24669, 17, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:43:59.512+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:43:59.540+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21016280, $f$Endowed$f$, ARRAY[$f$Sath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Shen Qingqiu was going to have a qi deviation if people didn’t stop staring at her shijie’s breasts! Didn’t Yue Qingyuan realize their effect on others—even Shen Qingqiu?$f$, 2043, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-19T10:58:01.596+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-19T10:58:01.621+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21017822, $f$by five thunderbolts$f$, ARRAY[$f$persicae$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In the mafia, Hua Cheng is Jun Wu's most prized weapon, and the only one he trusts to watch over Xie Lian as he returns to the triad that raised him.
But as the triad itself gets caught up in the war between cruelty and kindness, Hua Cheng's loyalty to Bai Wu Xiang might be what saves them all.$f$, 6414, 1, 3, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-18T05:24:06.106+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-18T05:24:06.129+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21019295, $f$get closer to me$f$, ARRAY[$f$etheriums$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He can imagine the picture he makes — hair a complete mess, lips red and swollen, legs spread open. They're sitting right in front of his statue, the one Hua Cheng made of him. The same person who's now worshipping him in a way only he can.$f$, 3407, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-23T12:27:10.598+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-23T12:27:10.624+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21029582, $f$Red Blades Hidden in the Overgrowth$f$, ARRAY[$f$mercyandmagic$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lan XiChen is initially relieved when the Stygian Tiger Seal restores Nie MingJue's consciousness, allowing all three sworn brothers to emerge from the GuanYin Temple alive. But now Jin GuangYao is imprisoned to await surefire execution, and Nie MingJue struggles to accept life as a demonic creature he would have previously purged.Becoming his father’s son and marrying A-Yao might just be XiChen's best option, even if it breaks Nie MingJue’s undead heart. XiYao, with copious brotherly 3Zun feels. Written for 3Zun Week 2019.
            
            Nie Mingyue asks Nie HuaiSang for the full story.
          
