($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21036920, $f$Don't Think$f$, ARRAY[$f$Haserl$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Unexpectedly, that blind devotion made Xie Lian’s body react. However, instead of his ridiculous rites of the past, where he would chant sutras and meditate, Xie Lian decided to indulge that feeling. He didn’t care anymore about keeping his body pure. After all, was there anything more blemished than his body?$f$, 730, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-18T05:29:02.259+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-18T05:29:02.283+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21044966, $f$MXTX Kinktober 2019 Collection$f$, ARRAY[$f$JemTheKingOfSass$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$31 chapters of prompt-based kink ficlets, one chapter per prompt. Each chapter title will have the pairing and the kink. Each chapter's top notes will contain all additional tags appropriate for the content. Everything in this fic is safe, sane(ish), consensual, and all in good fun! Please don't take any of this too seriously or as a how-to guide for any of the included kinks. Beware: my angst kink is present in every chapter.$f$, 45517, 31, 31, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:50:58.400+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:50:58.422+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-31T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
