($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21199079, $f$As Bright As His Smile$f$, ARRAY[$f$heefa171$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian didn't expect that one sip he gave to Lan Wangji the night before the man left Yiling, changed everything$f$, 43243, 8, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:43:38.406+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:43:38.427+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21201062, $f$Veneration of the Dead$f$, ARRAY[$f$tetsuyacchi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu might have died a vengeful, angry young man, but he was remembered by those that mattered as a saint; a bestower to their happy ending.Wei Wuxian and Lan Wangji would continue to visit the tablet, hoping to honour Mo Xuanyu’s memory until their last.$f$, 1485, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-01T14:19:59.355+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-01T14:19:59.382+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21203111, $f$my cup of tea$f$, ARRAY[$f$yupetals$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$my cup of tea (bubble tea!au / model!au)Have you heard? The Lan Law Firm’s Lan WangJi, HanGuang-Jun, is having an affair with the sponsored party, Bun-T’s co-owner Wei WuXian!pairings: wangxian (main), xicheng, hualian, fengqingrating: t but may go up as we progress through the storypreview:
  Warm light from the morning sun danced on Lan WangJi’s parted bangs and reached down to lay gently on his cheeks. He looked good in lighting of any kind. Wei WuXian suddenly remembered the night sky and the glow of a thousand fireflies reflected on Lan WangJi’s visage in the distance.$f$, 5015, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:40:37.696+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:40:37.722+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21204467, $f$How Do the Petals Unfurl?$f$, ARRAY[$f$MrMissMrsRandom$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lan Zhan's winter of romance begins to unfold into unexpected spring when he least expects it.$f$, 2160, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:51:42.409+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:51:42.423+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21219722, $f$Holding the world in my hands$f$, ARRAY[$f$Lucky_Moony$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The Yiling Patriarch has often claimed that if he could bear a little Master Lan for his husband, he would do so.Does this mean that Lan Sizhui will finally get the siblings he has once asked for?$f$, 11747, 6, 12, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:25.056+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:25.104+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21225155, $f$"Did I even ever matter to you?"$f$, ARRAY[$f$Jamilton_and_Lams$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Mo Dao Zu Shi$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A lie. It had all been a lie.(Why was he even surprised? When had life ever been fair to him?)He stands by the apartment door as he watches the money exchange hands and hears the groans of disbelief echoed through the group. He stands there watching the man he is in love with - the man he thought was in love with him - accepting the money with a grin$f$, 658, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:43:24.932+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:43:24.952+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21225986, $f$Fans From My Previous Life (In The Shadows)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Lynx_the_Defier$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$Naruto$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Nie HuaiSang reincarnates as Nara Shikamaru, and is not amused. Though, reflecting on the last years of his life, he rarely felt as such... Hmm... That probably said something about him, hasn't it?Having too much time to think, HuaiSang comes to many conclusions; being an adult in child's form is a horror; Chakra can be more useful than spiritual energy; he will enjoy this life!(Further years of Nara Shikamaru bring forth some porn, many cloud-watching sessions, experimenting with chakra and very confused parents)$f$, 5716, 5, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:46:12.323+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:46:12.361+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21230531, $f$trees whisper in the evening$f$, ARRAY[$f$sarrysar$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He wants Mo Xuanyu to know that he remembers him whenever he catches his reflection in the corner of his eye and doesn't look entirely like himself.$f$, 1635, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-11-04T12:52:21.539+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-04T12:52:21.565+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21232859, $f$The Head$f$, ARRAY[$f$tokki_bird$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$‘What would happen,’ Mo Xuanyu thinks, ‘if the head did have a body to attach to?’-He trembles, and his head feels worse. This isn’t his body. This isn’t his body at all.-The body-offering ritual works a bit differently, and Wei Wuxian's body was a bit less destroyed than the Jin Sect would have people believe.$f$, 1715, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-11-04T12:35:00.967+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-04T12:35:01.127+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21240269, $f$Softly, brightly$f$, ARRAY[$f$lanjingyeets$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Light paints Mo Xuanyu’s face with new shades and shadows.$f$, 509, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-26T02:45:30.734+00:00$f$, NULL, $f$2019-10-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21268175, $f$Чересчур далеко все  зашло$f$, ARRAY[$f$Grissel$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Лань Чжань не уверен, кого именно он любит.$f$, 2769, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:50:01.215+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:50:01.240+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21285329, $f$(Re)Collection$f$, ARRAY[$f$Graymalkyn$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A collection of stories (multichapter and one-shots) with different modern and an alternative settings of the Mo Dao Zu Shi universe. 1) Trigger --- Pet Shop assistant!Wei Ying & Musical prodigy!Wang Ji... But is that really his name? (And is that really the order of the couple?)2) This Time --- Heirs Lan Xichen and Jiang Cheng meet again during a speed dating experience to get elite wives.3) Me and Him or You and Me --- Lan Jingyi, Lan Sizhui, and Jin Ling face a particularly inquisitive demon.4) Concealed --- A slightly different take on the A/B/O setting for Lan Wangji, Wei Wuxian, and Mo Xuanyu.5) Under the Wisteria --- Song Lan & Xiao Xingchen take a break on a summer afternoon.6) Because of Him --- Jin Guangyao and Jiang Cheng bond over bad parenting and the cutest little nephew ever.7) (Readers' choice!)  (See note in the first chapter.)$f$, 8049, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:35:33.685+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:35:33.708+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21286034, $f$Murder at the Masquerade$f$, ARRAY[$f$krazieLeylines$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“You better behave tonight,” Jiang Cheng spoke up, poking a hole into Wei Wuxian’s thoughts. “Just because we’ll be in disguise does not mean your actions won’t have consequences. If I hear of any mischief, I will know exactly who to blame.”Wei Wuxian laughed again. “Well, that’s not fair,” he replied, “Is that not the whole purpose of a masquerade? To let ourselves be unrestrained, just for one night, with no strings attached?”(In which the Jin family hosts a masquerade.)$f$, 20575, 3, 8, false, 1, false, $f$2019-11-28T01:41:08.258+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-28T01:41:08.285+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21341053, $f$Switched$f$, ARRAY[$f$shorimochi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV) RPF$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When an actor transmigrated into a fictional world, and a fictional character transmigrated into the real world.There are a lot of things Xiao Zhan could do - sing, dance, act, cook, draw - but not fighting cultivators, and definitely not summon an army of corpses! Most importantly, how can he handle being around Wang Yibo's fictional self when he knew the man had been fantasising about him since fifteen?Wei Wuxian swore just a few minutes ago he was still out there, destroying the Wens who had taken away his home, but when he opened his eyes he arrived at a dreamland where there are moving pictures, metal carriages, and people are so rich they poop in a beautiful white porcelain throne. Also, why does the Lan Zhan he saw smile so often and talk so much?$f$, 95106, 59, 59, true, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:53:46.106+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:53:46.142+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
