($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21360367, $f$Don't Look Down$f$, ARRAY[$f$dragonofeternal$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu had been plagued by a sense of foreboding long before he was exiled from Koi Tower.$f$, 758, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-11-19T03:38:30.263+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-19T03:38:30.287+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21363322, $f$eternal gull enmity$f$, ARRAY[$f$havisham$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Lighthouse (2019)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Like the Rime of the Ancient Mariner, but smaller and dirtier and also not like that at all: after his death, Ephraim Winslow is turned into a enemy gull. He deals with it the best way he knows how: by antagonizing the doomed humans who followed behind him.$f$, 405, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-11-09T03:38:05.282+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-09T03:38:05.436+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21384055, $f$Wormwood and Gall$f$, ARRAY[$f$linguamortua$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The King (2019)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It didn’t do to be bitter. Only Hal was allowed to be bitter. Had John been a less obliging friend, and Hal not a prince, John might have made the observation that most of Hal’s tribulations were of his own devising. 


  He did devise, that boy.$f$, 1796, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:10:57.824+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:10:57.937+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
