($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21425764, $f$Marriage Negotiations$f$, ARRAY[$f$Miss_Writers_Block$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wherein Jiang Yanli Uses Her Power of Negotiation and Badassery to Befriend the Venerated Triad and Fix the Timeline$f$, 887, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:45:18.658+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:45:18.693+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21428275, $f$The Resurrected Turnabout$f$, ARRAY[$f$firesonic152$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The entire Mo family – mother, father, son – had been wiped out in a single night, found dead in their beds the next morning. The cause of death was the same for all of them: loss of blood due to an amputated left arm.Mo Xuanyu is tried for their murders and Lan Wangji discovers some new evidence in the process.$f$, 4065, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-11-28T22:25:53.160+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-28T22:25:53.184+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21454060, $f$The Best Plan$f$, ARRAY[$f$syriala$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“How many people are you plotting to get together?” Mo Xuanyu wants to know and pushes Nie Huaisang away from him before he can do something stupid, like lean in and kiss that manic smile right off his damn kissable lips.$f$, 1060, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-19T03:30:37.401+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-19T03:30:37.423+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21486421, $f$【瑶薛/凌薛】金麟台上黄金屋$f$, ARRAY[$f$blahblahzhou$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$瑶哥观音庙撒手人寰，给金凌留下了金家和一只洋。本文主CP瑶薛，凌薛，有晓薛、曦瑶、宋薛、瑶愫、瑶羽、忘羡提及，混乱邪恶，三观不正，决不洗白，飙儿童车，婶婶文学，在线偷窥，BE预警，没有QJ。$f$, 6625, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:35:15.349+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:35:15.390+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21492349, $f$Moments to collect$f$, ARRAY[$f$Lumeriel$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Nie MingJue has to go take care of the family home while his parents are traveling. To advance work, he invites his secretary to accompany him. Explanatory note for everyone (Mo XuanYu and Nie HuaiSang): this is NOT a date.However, Nie MingJue's plans will be altered when he discovers his father is at home. Mr. Nie has things to say ... and to show the guest.
 
What would be the reaction of Nie MingJue's father to Meng Yao?
 
Twitter debate promoted by this humble me and with exquisite contributions from @sukaretorozu (see her art! She is a goddess!), @Rrbonapett (what to say about her art!) And someone else; but my memory is terrible.$f$, 7768, 6, 6, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:33:12.585+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:33:12.605+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21501637, $f$Distraction$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu knew it was wrong to fantasize over his half-brother (but you're only fantasizing, it's not like you'll ever act on it, what's the harm, right?), so when he starts noticing a mysterious handsome man hanging around Langling Jin (who's so beautiful, surely he can't be another bastard of Jin Guangshan's, right?), he lets his fantasies run away from him (maybe you'll finally get over your brother, and not be hopelessly in love with two unreachable men, right?)
When his half-brother approaches him with an opportunity to improve his cultivation, how could he refuse the potential to raise his standing in his brother's eyes? And who would've expected it would come with the chance to get to work with the other man who's been plaguing his fantasies too!
Unfortunately, Mo Xuanyu keeps getting distracted by the handsome man he's supposed to study with (and by thoughts of your brother), which eventually leads to Xue Yang proposing a way for Mo Xuanyu to get some more... practical experience with demonic cultivation. What could POSSIBLY go wrong?
(CW: rape and necrophilia)$f$, 3702, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-12-03T12:48:18.591+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-03T12:48:18.636+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21505258, $f$falling in love with the right person$f$, ARRAY[$f$Cedric_B$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$ceo!xichen x social worker!jiang cheng. based off a tumblr au.~Jiang Cheng didn't have any regrets. No he didn't. Not until Jin Ling decided to run around with a particularly sharp butter knife, that he just knew Xue Yang had probably given the child. "JIN LING YOU GET BACK HERE-I'm so sorry" he stated towards the man, whose foot had been ran over by the child. "YOU THREE GET BACK HERE" his words may have been sharp, but the fondness in his gaze, made Xichen's heart race, he hadn't even gotten the man's name before he was running again."Brother, are you okay?""Of course, why would I not be?""Your bleeding" his younger brother gestured to the slight cut from the butter knife he had received from the child, but if he had to suffer another injury from the child, he would, he totally would, especially if it meant that angel in the dark purple velvet suit would speak to him again."I will be" he promised, gaze twinkling at the sight of the grumpy purple man holding three children in his arms.$f$, 11872, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:15:26.558+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:15:26.590+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21581224, $f$【双聂ABO】铁血$f$, ARRAY[$f$Ilovexiexie666$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$乾元=Alpha  中庸=Beta  坤泽=Omega  雨露期=发情期  信香=信息素  清心丹=抑制剂  结契=标记$f$, 25316, 8, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:20:45.348+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:20:45.367+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21591349, $f$Supernatural Hospital$f$, ARRAY[$f$The_Sassiest_Trixster$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$At Supernatural General, Dr. Lan Wangji tackles health mysteries with his partner, Dr. Wei Wuxian and their team of brilliant supernatural doctors. While some of their methods may be unconventional, Dr. Lan, Dr. Wei, and their team strive to make sure that every patient under their care is well taken care of...and survives.$f$, 14282, 10, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:49:28.596+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:49:28.625+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
