($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21638764, $f$Switched - Extras$f$, ARRAY[$f$shorimochi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV) RPF$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A collection of extra chapters from previous fic, 'Switched'.In which characters and actors found themselves transmigrated out of their will into unexpected worlds.Luo Binghe travelled across dimensions to look for his love.Meanwhile, Xiao Zhan and Wang Yibo had already met the dimension-crossing demon's beloved master before.And Wei Wuxian is _____$f$, 19719, 12, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:51:57.781+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:51:57.810+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
