($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21646795, $f$Musician between doctors$f$, ARRAY[$f$LanYiLan$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Mo Dao Zu Shi$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei WuXian dissapeard from the eyes of his beloved. He is hiding from his family, from his lover and kids. The, the renown, pop star dissapeard with no trace. Everyone think he passed away.He returns after 20 years of being away, Wei WuXian comes back, as a teacher and the University of medicine, Cloud Recesses university, from Gusu, renoun because, because the medicine curriculum, they also have an art club and a music club, where Wei WuXian will become the teacher of. But he didn't thought that, there he will see, after 20 years from being apart, he ones he missed he loved.$f$, 2177, 2, 2, true, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:51:03.758+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:51:03.775+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
