($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21699097, $f$I Will Become What I Deserve$f$, ARRAY[$f$rivlee$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A series of ficlets focused on the Nie Brothers in the LAHL 'verse.$f$, 13012, 9, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-29T14:13:02.227+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-29T14:13:02.252+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21700930, $f$music of the night (phantom of the opera AU)$f$, ARRAY[$f$viktuuriousred$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian of Yunmeng has unheard of talent. An actor, a singer, a musician, and a successful librettist/playwright to name a few of his many abilities. He has brought his continent-wide famous opera entitled, quite plainly, "Opera Ghost" to one of the most famous opera houses in the west, and much is riding on the reception the Europeans give him for the performances. Too nervous to perform in the premier of "Opera Ghost" as the androgynous lead, the captivating "Christian", he sends out his understudy Xue Yang, who, quite frankly, bombs his performance. Wei Wuxian is forced onto the stage at the beginning of the second act after an unexpected accident, where he stuns the Parisian audience and causes a young foreigner in the crowd, a Viscount of Chinese nobility, in European terms, to summon the courage to reunite with his childhood friend.While the Viscount (Lan Wangji) and Wei Wuxian realize their feelings for one another, there are a lot of strange goings-on at the opera house. How is it possible for Wei Wuxian to be so inhumanly talented, for one? Who is his great tutor? Who is responsible for these mysterious accidents impacting other talented actors? Why is Box 5 in the balcony always kept empty?$f$, 1751, 1, 16, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:51:12.754+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:51:12.778+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21702763, $f$Rebirth$f$, ARRAY[$f$IllusoryCrystal$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Another reincarnation fic no one asked for.$f$, 8149, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-29T18:15:18.858+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-29T18:15:18.884+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21707392, $f$Phantom Pain$f$, ARRAY[$f$Hamliet$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Have you heard? Sect Leader Lan married his disgraced sworn brother! His brother eloped with the Yiling Patriarch, the new young Sect Leader Jin disrespects Sect Leader Jiang at every turn, and the Head-Shaker turned to demonic cultivation to revive his brother! After Jin Ling makes a decision with drastic consequences at the Guanyin Temple, the four sects find themselves caught up in chaos. When phantom attacks begin, no one is quite sure whether to blame one of the two known villains lurking in the Cloud Recesses, or if a new villain has emerged.$f$, 3774, 1, 13, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:49:23.914+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:49:23.942+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21707953, $f$Plum Blossoms$f$, ARRAY[$f$moonlightsubaki$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“The fragrance of plum blossom comes from bitterness and coldness.”Getting turned into a vampire was not what Wei Wuxian meant when he asked for his last year of university to be eventful.$f$, 2864, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:49:15.066+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:49:15.088+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21711781, $f$reality? (never heard of that server)$f$, ARRAY[$f$cereal_whore$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Who the fuck is 'Wei Wuxian and Junk Cheng are Cool'?" Jin Zixuan squints."What the heck is a 'Junk Cheng' and how do I protect myself from it?" Jin Rulan scrunches his nose.-Modern AU where a virtual reality game is more desirable than real-life (bc it suc ks), leaving players pulling a global warming by pretending like there's not a problem in ignoring reality.Wei Wuxian and Jiang Chen, amateurs playing to rack up money to pay off a debt from a loanshark, are unknowingly good at the game. Then, they hear about an official competition. The reward? A wish granted by the game's creators. Winning is a literal solution to their current financial and abusive living situation. Problem is? They need five members to enter, and that each team only gets one wish. With five assholes forced to work together, striving for an individual wish that’d fix their own tragic backstory written like they’re on b99, they might not even cooperate long enough to even reach the second problem. Or: the fic where Wei Wuxian, Jiang Chen, Lan Wangji, Jin Zixuan, and Nie Huaisang have to get along long enough without Yanlin Jiejie's hand-holding.$f$, 8713, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:21:30.487+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:21:30.517+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21716716, $f$Wassail$f$, ARRAY[$f$Ladybug_21$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Bletchley Circle$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"Caroling?"  Jean turned to Lucy."Even during times of war, Christmas should be all about joy and harmony," Lucy said earnestly.$f$, 2828, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2020-01-16T04:06:00.918+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-16T04:06:00.946+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21719029, $f$Multiverse Collection$f$, ARRAY[$f$Christian_Richtown$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mostly Xicheng and Wangxian drabbles from a prompt list that exploded on my tumblr. Wanted to give them a proper home here where I could categorize them more properly and make them easier to access/read in order. Will be updated daily with two chapters going up together.Featuring my Greek Gods AU, Psychic Detectives AU, Time Master and the Tailor AU, and Vampire!JC AU, among others.$f$, 3520, 2, 29, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:20:13.839+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:20:13.880+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21720853, $f$To a Green Thought in a Green Shade$f$, ARRAY[$f$bleustocking$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Kreios, a vampire, longs to die. He learns of a creature that can possibly end his long life and pursues every end to get what he wants.$f$, 2956, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-12-15T07:52:20.810+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-15T07:52:21.021+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21733894, $f$When It Hurts to Remember$f$, ARRAY[$f$Naamah_Beherit$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He comes to his senses in a dark, empty cave, amidst the rocks and rubble he brought down with himself. Somewhere above him, a sliver of a red sky can be seen, far enough that he can’t reach it. Not now, when he barely moves.

  It’s a funny thing, moving as a ghost. It’s the idea, the will and determination to transfer consciousness in iterations, to slither one’s thoughts into the cracks of the world where there are none. He’s done it, he thinks. He has never tried it, he fears. He sees no point in doing it, he knows. But

   

  There is something he should remember.
**10 years of madness. Hua Cheng in Mount TongLu.$f$, 4063, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-12-26T03:53:29.158+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-26T03:53:29.199+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21747343, $f$Another Life$f$, ARRAY[$f$Liyi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In Which Mo Xuanyu is Wei Wuxian's brother.$f$, 336, 1, NULL, false, 1, false, $f$2019-12-29T19:56:26.337+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-29T19:56:26.493+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21748861, $f$The Truth in the Light$f$, ARRAY[$f$Fairleigh$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Lighthouse (2019)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Thomas saw that truth in the light, and he recoiled from it. Then, he fell.$f$, 1026, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2020-01-05T19:46:23.768+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-05T19:46:23.796+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21771877, $f$In the Shattering of Things$f$, ARRAY[$f$Naamah_Beherit$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A war's coming to an end - and so does life.Or: Hua Cheng, the end. And the beginning.$f$, 1985, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-12-26T04:03:21.272+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-26T04:03:21.303+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21795946, $f$in part at least, golden$f$, ARRAY[$f$phantomlistener$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Bletchley Circle$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Millie didn’t know where the skates had come from but Bletchley was suddenly awash with them, passed from girl to girl with indiscriminate goodwill. At lunchtimes and in the evenings they congregated on the ice, slipping and laughing their way in orderly circles clockwise around the edge; the more daring amongst them ventured into the middle, where they twirled perfect figure-of-eights and danced hand-in-hand to the good-natured applause of their friends.
Winter at Bletchley turns to ice and snow, and Millie has time to reflect.$f$, 2243, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2020-01-06T13:57:57.320+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-06T13:57:57.349+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21799897, $f$Before, During, After$f$, ARRAY[$f$Jenett$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$England Series - K. J. Charles$f$, $f$Think of England - K. J. Charles$f$, $f$Proper English - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Meeting Fen Carruth entirely changed Pat Merton's life for the better. That they get to solve mysteries together is a delightful bonus. (Pat's experiences before, during, and after the events of Think of England)$f$, 7024, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2020-01-04T18:07:35.637+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-04T18:07:35.662+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21825148, $f$Avowal$f$, ARRAY[$f$persicae$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$哪吒之魔童降世 | Né Zhā Zhī Mó Tóng Jiàng Shì (2019)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It doesn't matter how much dragon blood flows through Ao Bing's veins - he learned early on that to survive was to be human. But Nezha is intrigued despite Ao Bing's attempts to keep his dragon form hidden, and it's not long before Ao Bing finds himself at war with his own heart.Nezha makes sure he isn't fighting that war alone.$f$, 13440, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2020-01-05T09:08:40.171+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-05T09:08:40.214+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21830464, $f$distractions are hard to come by (but you're easy to find)$f$, ARRAY[$f$ThirtySixSaveFiles$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Jiang Cheng seems to get shown up by Wei Wuxian at every turn; Nie Huaisang has an idea about something Jiang Cheng can be first at.$f$, 1155, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-12-17T17:53:56.510+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-17T17:53:56.538+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 21837337, $f$heartbeats$f$, ARRAY[$f$rainingover$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$陈情令 | The Untamed (TV)$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Sometimes, Lan Wangji wants nothing more than to do away with all responsibilities—forget cultivation classes, forget guqin practise, forget politics and filial responsibility and everything else—and remain naked, warm and dreamlike, in the perfect state that only exists during the blissful comedown after sex with Wei Wuxian.$f$, 3769, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2020-01-06T12:39:57.730+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-06T12:39:57.774+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
